  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed studio flats in the loft space, by reason of their shortfalls on the London Plan internal space standards and inadequate private outdoor amenity provision, would result in a cramped, poor-quality living environment for future occupiers, contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policies D3 and D6 of the London Plan (2021), Policies DM1, DM26 and DM27 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013), the London Borough of Harrow’s Residential Design Guide Supplementary Planning Document (2010), and the London Plan Guidance - Housing Design Standards (2023).",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;The proposed development, by reason of its cumulative bulk\r\nand contrived design, particularly the poorly integrated flat roof rear\r\nextensions and dormers, would result in visually discordant and unsympathetic\r\nadditions failing to respect the integrity of the host buildings and the\r\ncharacter and amenity of the surrounding streetscape, contrary to the National\r\nPlanning Policy Framework (2024), Policies D3 and D6 of the London Plan (2021),\r\nPolicy CS1.B of the Harrow Core Strategy (2012), Policies DM1 and DM26 of the\r\nHarrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013) and the London Borough\r\nof Harrow’s Residential Design Guide Supplementary Planning Document\r\n(2010).&amp;nbsp;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
